  "integration_requirements": [
    "Original recovery runs first; noncomplete or nonempty reason stops before accounting refresh.",
    "Bind original Store and check exact binding before durable scheduler admission.",
    "Carry durable Attempt.AdmittedDay to Store; never resample it as a new authorization.",
    "Guard failure occurs before backend calls, credit import, signing, broadcast or commit.",
    "Original audited PendingBatch must be zero; a same-day prepared/pending batch is not a completed refresh slot.",
    "B59 remains one credit, B60 imports exactly one additional credit, repeat remains two.",
    "Original b/1 bytes/raw/claims and one signed batch remain unchanged across repeat and restart.",
    "Full same-day report may update outstanding balances and funding reasons; DailyCursor remains same day.",
    "V1 dispatch and every original dailyDue boundary remain unchanged.",
    "Expired expected day is a distinct no-effect ErrDailyRefreshExpired mapped to retryable unavailable; no fatal ordinary-midnight shutdown."
  ]
